{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_152_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_152","textTraditional":"一、二年，春，王正月，葬簡王。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_152_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_152","textTraditional":"二、鄭師伐宋。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_152_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_152","textTraditional":"三、夏，五月，庚寅，夫人姜氏薨。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_152_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_152","textTraditional":"四、六月，庚辰，鄭伯睔卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_152_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_152","textTraditional":"五、晉師、宋師、衞寧殖侵鄭。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_152_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_152","textTraditional":"其曰衞寧殖，如是而稱於前事也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_152_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_152","textTraditional":"六、秋，七月，仲孫蔑會晉荀罃、宋華元、衞孫林父、曹人、邾人於戚。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_152_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_152","textTraditional":"七、己丑，葬我小君齊姜。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_152_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_152","textTraditional":"八、叔孫豹如宋。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_152_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_152","textTraditional":"九、冬，仲孫蔑會晉荀罃、齊崔杼、宋華元、衞孫林父、曹人、邾人、滕人、薛人、小邾人於戚，城於虎牢。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_152_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_152","textTraditional":"若言中國焉，內鄭也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_152_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_152","textTraditional":"十、楚殺其大夫公子申。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}